<title>USA: Chrysler year-to-date sales beat 1988 record.</title>
<headline>Chrysler year-to-date sales beat 1988 record.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp said its U.S. vehicle sales from January 1, 1996 through November 22 reached 2,214,289.</p>
<p>This toppled a previous record -- sales of 2,208,057 achieved for all of 1988.</p>
<p>&quot;This record represents more than just our best year,&quot; said James Holden, exeuctive vice president-sales and marketing. &quot;We see it as a strong sign of what Chrysler is really capable of in the years ahead.&quot;</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
